    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/d49f71b1f60da9873750bd3e2b290fa1.avif?t=1754866524\" width=600 height=219 /></span><strong>FASTHAND</strong> is a fast-paced, minimalist arcade shooter where your main goal is to <strong>shoot appearing balls as quickly and accurately as possible</strong>. Sounds simple? Give it a try and you'll see how addictive it can get! This game is designed for players who want to improve their <strong>reaction speed and shooting accuracy</strong>, especially for <strong>FPS/TPS</strong> games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Game features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your reflexes and aiming precision</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple yet challenging gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 language versions \u2013 play your way!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean, minimal graphics that keep you focused</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Super affordable price</u></strong> \u2013 maximum value for less!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully developed by a solo indie developer \u2013 that\u2019s me!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FASTHAND</strong> is perfect for those looking for a fun yet useful way to improve their aim. Use it as a <strong>warm-up before competitive matches</strong>, or play a quick round during your break \u2013 either way, it's a great time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/0ad756ccced7c4274b475dcb46d340c3.avif?t=1754866524\" width=600 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey there!<br>This is my <strong>very first game</strong> \u2013 like, ever! So\u2026 sorry in advance if anything feels a little janky, if the balls get annoying, or if the menu looks like it was made in PowerPoint 2007 \ud83d\ude05<br>I <strong>really did my best</strong>, I promise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this is just the beginning.<br>I\u2019m planning to <strong>learn, fix bugs, add updates</strong>, and make this game better over time. And in the future? Who knows \u2013 maybe something bigger, cooler, and with fewer balls (or more, if you're into that \ud83d\ude02).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks so much for giving my little game a shot. Every \u201cPlay\u201d click means the world to me \u2764\ufe0f</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/d49f71b1f60da9873750bd3e2b290fa1.avif?t=1754866524\" width=600 height=219 /></span><strong>FASTHAND</strong> is a fast-paced, minimalist arcade shooter where your main goal is to <strong>shoot appearing balls as quickly and accurately as possible</strong>. Sounds simple? Give it a try and you'll see how addictive it can get! This game is designed for players who want to improve their <strong>reaction speed and shooting accuracy</strong>, especially for <strong>FPS/TPS</strong> games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Game features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your reflexes and aiming precision</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple yet challenging gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 language versions \u2013 play your way!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean, minimal graphics that keep you focused</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Super affordable price</u></strong> \u2013 maximum value for less!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully developed by a solo indie developer \u2013 that\u2019s me!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FASTHAND</strong> is perfect for those looking for a fun yet useful way to improve their aim. Use it as a <strong>warm-up before competitive matches</strong>, or play a quick round during your break \u2013 either way, it's a great time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/0ad756ccced7c4274b475dcb46d340c3.avif?t=1754866524\" width=600 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey there!<br>This is my <strong>very first game</strong> \u2013 like, ever! So\u2026 sorry in advance if anything feels a little janky, if the balls get annoying, or if the menu looks like it was made in PowerPoint 2007 \ud83d\ude05<br>I <strong>really did my best</strong>, I promise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this is just the beginning.<br>I\u2019m planning to <strong>learn, fix bugs, add updates</strong>, and make this game better over time. And in the future? Who knows \u2013 maybe something bigger, cooler, and with fewer balls (or more, if you're into that \ud83d\ude02).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks so much for giving my little game a shot. Every \u201cPlay\u201d click means the world to me \u2764\ufe0f</p>",
